WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,340
Now manifest it all, spend 200 million

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,700
Go to the Seventh Military District of the Frontline to acquire a heart of the Abyss Royal Family.

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,340
No matter what channel is used

4
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,940
Even if the price is 20%, you have to get it for me.

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:16,860
After buying it, I directly put the remaining 800 million into my core painting pool.

6
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,740
All used to equip my letter map with silver-level wise warrior weapons.

7
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,420
I will take the military district exam next month

8
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,860
Who dares to stand in the way of winning the special rank?

9
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,900
Just crush whoever it is

10
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,780
I hope you can survive until the military district exam

11
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,920
Don't let me down

12
00:00:34,240 --> 00:01:02,900
Fish amount: 300,000, faith points: 300,000

13
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,860
Never fought such a rich battle
